        "Id1": {
            "text": "The music for the movie \"English Without Tears\" was composed by Nicholas Brodszky, whereas the movie was edited by Alan Jaggs, produced and written by Anatole de Grunwald, while Bernard Knowles did the cinematography."
        },
        "Id2": {
            "text": "Anatole de Grunwald wrote and produced English Without Tears which was edited by Alan Jaggs and had Bernard Knowles as the cinematographer. Nicholas Brodszky composed the music of the movie."
        },
